# A3, launch-card-v2 always-show shape: LOCAL=unpushed (local progress matching no server
# revision) hands to the wizard like every launch — the v2 contract puts the whole decision
# in the engine, and the card's Saves view is the explicit, lose-proof restore path.
desc fetch hook: LOCAL=unpushed + newer foreign save -> full card handoff (engine owns the decision)
invoke prehook
config paired
romarg Roms/Game Boy Advance (GBA)/✓ Zelda.gba
sdfile+ Roms/Game Boy Advance (GBA)/✓ Zelda.gba
engine 0|202\t2026-07-02 08:00\tFlip\t33KB\n101\t2026-07-01 10:00\tBrick\t32KB\nLOCAL=unpushed
wizard 0|LAUNCHCARD mode=summoned shown=1 action=play evicted=0
expect_exit 0
expect_trace WIZARD --launch-card --summoned
expect_trace_absent LIST[
expect_trace_absent ENGINE --restore-save
expect_log local=unpushed action=card
